 html←packageIDs PrepareHtmlPageForPackageList mat;groups;group;bool;noOf
⍝ Returns the page listing all packages, grouped by their group.
⍝ `mat` comes from `GetPackageList_`, one row per package; see there for the columns.
⍝ The filter, the sort switch and "Include tags in the filter" are done by the script
⍝ Assets/JS/package-list.js. Every row carries what that script needs as data attributes.
⍝ Without JavaScript the page is still complete, only without those tools: they are written
⍝ with `hidden` set, and the script shows them.
 html←(⍬ 'Packages' '/packages')HtmlHeader⊂'<script src="/Assets/JS/package-list.js" defer></script>'
 html,←⊂'<h2>Packages <span class="row-count" id="pkg-count">',(⍕≢mat),'</span></h2>'
 html,←⊂'<div class="list-tools" id="pkg-tools" hidden>'
 html,←⊂'<div class="filter-row">'
 html,←⊂'<label class="filter" for="pkg-filter"><span class="sr-only">Filter the packages</span><input type="search" id="pkg-filter" placeholder="Filter by name, description or group…" autocomplete="off"><kbd title="Press / to jump into the filter">/</kbd></label>'
 html,←⊂'<div class="sort-switch" id="pkg-sort"><span>Sort by</span><div class="pill" role="group" aria-label="Sort by">'
 html,←⊂'<button type="button" data-sort="group" aria-pressed="true">Group</button>'
 html,←⊂'<button type="button" data-sort="name" aria-pressed="false">Name</button>'
 html,←⊂'<button type="button" data-sort="majors" aria-pressed="false">Major versions</button>'
 html,←⊂'</div></div>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'
 html,←⊂'<label class="include-tags" for="pkg-include-tags"><input type="checkbox" id="pkg-include-tags">Include tags in the filter</label>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'
 html,←⊂'<p class="legend"><span><b>L</b>Linux</span><span><b>M</b>macOS</span><span><b>W</b>Windows</span><span><span class="uc-flag uc-yes" aria-hidden="true"></span>user command</span></p>'
 html,←⊂'<div class="pkg-list" id="pkg-list">'
 :If 0<≢mat
     groups←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'-'}¨mat[;1]                   ⍝ The group is what comes before the first hyphen
     :For group :In ∪groups
         bool←groups≡¨⊂group
         noOf←+/bool
         html,←⊂'<section class="pkg-group">'
         html,←⊂'<div class="pkg-group-head"><h3>',(EscapeSpecialChars group),'</h3><span>',(⍕noOf),' package',((1≠noOf)/'s'),'</span></div>'
         html,←⊂'<div class="pkg-rows">'
         html,←PrepareHtmlPageForPackageList_¨↓bool⌿mat
         html,←⊂'</div>'
         html,←⊂'</section>'
     :EndFor
 :EndIf
⍝ Sorted by name or by number of major versions the rows are moved in here by the script
 html,←⊂'<div class="pkg-rows pkg-flat" id="pkg-flat" hidden></div>'
 html,←⊂'</div>'
 html,←⊆GetFooter
 html,←⊂'</body>'
 html,←⊂'</html>'
⍝Done
